parameters.text:
=Analyze the skills trend data and create a personal development roadmap.

Field: {{ $('Set Skills Config').item.json.field }}
Current Skills I Have: {{ $('Set Skills Config').item.json.current_skills }}

Rising Skills This Month:
{{ $('Find Rising Skills').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

Declining Skills:
{{ $('Find Declining Skills').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

Certification Trends:
{{ $('Find Certification Trends').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

Return JSON:
{
  "rising_skills": [{"skill": "", "growth_signal": "strong/moderate", "time_to_learn": ""}],
  "declining_skills": [{"skill": "", "replaced_by": ""}],
  "skills_i_have_that_are_rising": [],
  "skills_i_have_that_are_declining": [],
  "priority_skills_to_learn": [{"skill": "", "reason": "", "resource": "", "time_needed": ""}],
  "certifications_worth_pursuing": [{"name": "", "provider": "", "time": "", "cost": ""}],
  "skills_to_deprioritize": [],
  "6_month_learning_plan": [],
  "monthly_summary": "3-4 sentence summary of this month's skill trends"
}

=📈 *Monthly Skills Trend Report — {{ $now.toFormat('MMMM yyyy') }}*

{{ $json.monthly_summary }}

*Rising skills to learn:*
{{ $json.priority_skills_to_learn.slice(0,3).map(s=>`• ${s.skill}: ${s.reason} (${s.time_needed})`).join('\n') }}

*Skills I have that are rising:*
{{ $json.skills_i_have_that_are_rising.map(s=>`✅ ${s}`).join('\n') }}

*Certifications worth pursuing:*
{{ $json.certifications_worth_pursuing.slice(0,2).map(c=>`• ${c.name} — ${c.provider}`).join('\n') }}

Full report in Notion.
